  "bio": "Jimmy Tomes is renowned in Delray Beach for his meticulous skill in dotwork tattoos, a style that requires a great deal of precision and expertise. Tattooing since 1997, Jimmy's vast experience is evident in the exquisite detail and subtlety of every piece he creates. Clients admire his professionalism, which, combined with his talent, has established him as a highly respected artist in the United States tattoo community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Delray Beach, Florida, United States",
  "tattooing_since": "1997"
